WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Extended Side Angle, thread the bottom arm under the front thigh.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Reach the top arm behind the back and clasp the hands or a strap.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Press the front thigh back into the bind and spiral the chest open.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Gaze softens upward or forward; keep the back leg strong.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then release the bind and switch sides.
